{
  "_comment": [
    "App tunnel test vectors (D204, native/spec/tunnel.md §10). Generated by xbind:",
    "UPDATE_VECTORS=1 go test ./internal/apptunnel/noise -run Vectors. Binary values are lowercase hex",
    "unless named for the link (serverKey, pskLink: base64url without padding).",
    "Each vector is one handshake: the device (initiator) writes message 1 with its ephemeral, xbind",
    "(responder) answers with message 2 using its own; both reach handshakeHash (h) and the code (sas).",
    "Transport frames per direction are in order, from nonce 0: plaintext = type(1) ‖ body, AD empty;",
    "after a rekey frame (type 1) the sender's CipherState runs REKEY() (Noise §11.3; the nonce keeps",
    "counting) and later frames use the new key. A close frame (type 2) ends the direction.",
    "Invalid cases reuse their base vector with the fields given and must fail where step says.",
    "cacophony: the Noise community's IK and IKpsk2 vectors for this suite, checked against the same code."
  ],
